    <string name="guide_title">How to Enable Accessibility</string>
    <string name="guide_intro">Android blocks accessibility for apps installed outside the Play Store until you allow restricted settings.</string>
    <string name="guide_step1">In accessibility settings, open \'Installed apps\' (or \'Downloaded apps\') and try to turn on \'KakaoTalk Ad Chat Cleanup\'. If a \'Restricted setting\' notice appears, tap OK.</string>
    <string name="guide_step2">In app info, tap ⋮ at the top right, choose \'Allow restricted settings\' and verify it\'s you. The menu appears only after step 1.</string>
    <string name="guide_step3">Go back to accessibility settings and turn on the service.</string>
